        "en": "Clients widely praise the clinical and support staff for their warmth, friendliness, and professionalism. Reviewers single out Dr. Zendeja, Ciara, Lauren, and Emily for walking pet owners through treatment options step by step and remaining calm and patient even during challenging or messy clinical moments."
