      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently commend the clinic's efficient appointment flow and accessibility for urgent care needs. Multiple reviewers report being seen on short notice or the same day, booking online easily across all seven days of the week, and finishing appointments within thirty minutes without long waits."
      }
    },
