        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the genuine care and affection shown to their puppies, adult dogs, and cats. Clients appreciate that staff make difficult medical visits smooth and comforting, handling nervous or ailing animals with sensitivity and maintaining a calm atmosphere during exams and compassionate end-of-life care."
      }
